OL,3,GOPINIONCBBC Weather changes: some
OL,4,Cbright spells, some grey areas
OL,5,
OL,6,FAnother day...another round of BBC
OL,7,Fcuts.
OL,9,FThis is becoming depressingly familiar
OL,11,FBut ` putting aside the financial
OL,12,Farguments ` are the changes to BBC
OL,13,FWeather an appropriate move?
OL,15,FConcerning as BBC cuts are, services
OL,16,Fmust be value for money and run
OL,17,Fefficiently.
OL,19,FHad the BBC's weather service grown
OL,20,Fexponentially as news output expanded?
OL,21,FDid it need to get back to basics?
OL,23,EPub: 30-Jul-2026Upppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBClean FeedCNat TVFOn This Day
FL,144,140,200,120,0,100
PN,14302
SC,0002
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F143A1786257690
OL,1,W~+$ hw1~{4~k4 ~shw1~sj7}         G2/5
OL,2,W+.!+,"-$/*%/*% / "-$+,*-'U(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GOPINIONCBBC Weather changes: some
OL,4,Cbright spells, some grey areas
OL,5,
OL,6,FAnd is the shake up announced today the
OL,7,Flast word?
OL,9,FIt makes sense to base the Breakfast
OL,10,Fweather presenter in Salford.
OL,12,FBut why will there be no full national
OL,13,Fforecast during the News at One? Surely
OL,14,Fthe Breakfast presenter could do that
OL,15,Ftoo?
OL,17,FThere will still be a full forecast
OL,18,Fduring the News at Six and, initially
OL,19,Fat least, the News at Ten.
OL,21,FBut what about the weekends?
OL,23,EPub: 30-Jul-2026Upppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBClean FeedCNat TVFOn This Day
FL,144,140,200,120,0,100
PN,14303
SC,0003
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F143A1786257690
OL,1,W~+$ hw1~{4~k4 ~shw1~sj7}         G3/5
OL,2,W+.!+,"-$/*%/*% / "-$+,*-'U(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GOPINIONCBBC Weather changes: some
OL,4,Cbright spells, some grey areas
OL,5,
OL,6,FI do wonder.
OL,8,FThere is certainly too much overlap
OL,9,Fbetween the national and regional
OL,10,Fforecasts. But should that mean that
OL,11,Fonly one is necessary?
OL,13,FThere have been many occasions over the
OL,14,Fyears when BBC nations have
OL,15,Fsuccessfully produced forecasts which
OL,16,Ftake in the UK and world picture.
OL,18,FCan this format work permanently? And
OL,19,Fapply too to the English regions?
OL,21,FLet's wait and see.
OL,23,EPub: 30-Jul-2026Upppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBClean FeedCNat TVFOn This Day
FL,144,140,200,120,0,100
