OL,3,GOPINIONCBBC Weather changes: some
OL,4,Cbright spells, some grey areas
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe loss of full weather forecasts on
OL,7,Fthe News Channel is disappointing but
OL,8,Fthe audience is modest.
OL,10,FHopefully all the staff affected by the
OL,11,Fchanges will be ok.
OL,13,FAnd hopefully today is the current plan
OL,14,Fand not necessarily the last word.
OL,16,FThere are some changes which leave me
OL,17,Funeasy and others which can arguably be
OL,18,Fsaid to have merit.
OL,20,FLet's have a discussion.
OL,23,EPub: 30-Jul-2026Upppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBClean FeedCNat TVFOn This Day
FL,144,140,200,120,0,100
